  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the permission-aware `VoiceInputComponent` using Jetpack Compose, designed to safely handle microphone permissions and capture voice intent for the Gemini NLU integration. \n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n\n- **Permission Management**: Utilized `rememberLauncherForActivityResult` combined with `ActivityResultContracts.RequestPermission()` to seamlessly request the `android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO` permission within the Compose lifecycle if it is not already granted.\n- **Native Speech Recognition**: Integrated the native Android `SpeechRecognizer` API. It continuously updates the UI state while listening and gracefully handles error callbacks (e.g., timeouts, no match, network issues). \n- **Accessible & Dynamic UI**: Designed a highly visible, rounded button that dynamically shifts background colors and icons (`Mic` to `Stop`) when recording is active. It also leverages `semantics { contentDescription }` to ensure screen readers provide accurate feedback on the button\'s active state.\n- **Integration**: Added the new component to the `MainActivity` layout as a primary bottom-anchored action area, and updated the `AndroidManifest.xml` to include the required audio and internet permissions."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the permission-aware `VoiceInputComponent` using Jetpack Compose, designed to safely handle microphone permissions and capture voice intent for the Gemini NLU integration. \n\nHere is a summary of the implementation:\n\n- **Permission Management**: Utilized `rememberLauncherForActivityResult` combined with `ActivityResultContracts.RequestPermission()` to seamlessly request the `android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO` permission within the Compose lifecycle if it is not already granted.\n- **Native Speech Recognition**: Integrated the native Android `SpeechRecognizer` API. It continuously updates the UI state while listening and gracefully handles error callbacks (e.g., timeouts, no match, network issues). \n- **Accessible & Dynamic UI**: Designed a highly visible, rounded button that dynamically shifts background colors and icons (`Mic` to `Stop`) when recording is active. It also leverages `semantics { contentDescription }` to ensure screen readers provide accurate feedback on the button\'s active state.\n- **Integration**: Added the new component to the `MainActivity` layout as a primary bottom-anchored action area, and updated the `AndroidManifest.xml` to include the required audio and internet permissions."
