  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Application Details**\n\nI\'ve begun reviewing the details of \"Easy Launcher,\" an accessible Android launcher developed by GlitchLab Studio. The focus is accessibility for seniors and those with motor or visual impairments. I\'m noting the Italian translations as well.\n\n\n**Analyzing Core Functionality**\n\nI\'m now diving into the project\'s evolution, focusing on its Jetpack Compose M3 foundation, especially the high-contrast design and large touch targets. The layout is designed for accessibility, with tactile cards and a glowing voice assistant pill. I\'m taking a close look at the Gemini NLU integration, including multi-turn function calling using `gemini-2.5-flash` and its defined tools.\n\n\n**Examining Life Safety Features**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the emergency SOS system. The state machine, 5-second countdown with cancel option, and alert tone generation with `ToneGenerator` are key. The `SosEmergencyForegroundService` is interesting, particularly the 10-second audio recording, and high-accuracy GPS with Google Play Services. I\'m focusing on the automated dispatch through SMS and WhatsApp.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 8
      nanos: 57491094
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
