        lines {
          text: "You can define a Grid container configuration to create flexible layouts"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "that respond to different screen sizes and content types."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "This page describes how to do the following:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [Define a grid](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/grid/container-properties#grid-definition): Set up the basic structure of rows and columns."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [Place items in a grid](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/grid/container-properties#item-placement): Understand how items are placed into grid cells and how to change flow direction."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [Manage track sizing](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/grid/container-properties#grid-track-size): Use fixed, percentage, flexible, and intrinsic sizing to set track sizes."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [Set gaps](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/grid/container-properties#grid-gap): Manage the \"gutters\" between rows and columns."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Define a grid"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "A grid consists of columns and rows."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The [`Grid`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/layout/Grid.composable#Grid(kotlin.Function1,androidx.compose.ui.Modifier,kotlin.Function1)) composable has a `config` parameter"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "that accepts a lambda to define the columns and rows"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "within [`GridConfigurationScope`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/layout/GridConfigurationScope)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The following example defines a grid that has three rows and two columns,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "each with a fixed size specified in [`Dp`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/ui/unit/Dp):"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Grid("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    config = {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        repeat(2) {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            column(160.dp)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        repeat(3) {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            row(90.dp)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
