          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "![The flow function changes the direction to place items.](https://developer.android.com/static/develop/ui/compose/images/layouts/adaptive/grid/grid-flow.png) **Figure 2** . `GridFlow.Row` (left) and `GridFlow.Column` (right)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Manage track sizing"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Rows and columns are collectively referred to as a [grid track](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/grid#grid-track)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "You can specify the size of a grid track using one of the following methods:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Fixed** (`Dp`): Allocates a specific size (e.g., `column(180.dp)`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Percentage** (`Float`): Allocates a percentage of the total available space from `0.0f` to `1.0f` (e.g., `row(0.5f)` for 50%)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Flexible** ([`Fr`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/layout/Fr)): Distributes remaining space proportionally after fixed and percentage tracks are calculated. For example, if two rows are set to `1.fr` and `3.fr`, the latter receives 75% of the remaining height."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Intrinsic** : Sizes the track based on the content inside it. For more information, see [Determine grid track size intrinsically](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/grid/container-properties#intrisic-grid-track-size)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The following example uses the different track sizing options"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "to define the row heights:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Grid("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
