        }
        lines {
          text: "![Row heights defined using the four primary track sizing options.](https://developer.android.com/static/develop/ui/compose/images/layouts/adaptive/grid/track-sizes.png) **Figure 3** . Row heights defined using the four primary track sizing options in `Grid`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Set the minimum size for flexible grid tracks"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "When a grid container has no remaining space,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "a standard flexible track can shrink to `0.dp`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "To prevent this and ensure content isn\'t crushed,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "use [`GridTrackSize.MinMax`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/layout/GridTrackSize#MinMax(androidx.compose.ui.unit.Dp,androidx.compose.foundation.layout.Fr))"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "to enforce an explicit minimum size while keeping the track flexible."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The following example allocates at least `100.dp` to the first row:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Grid("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    config = {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        column(1f)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        // The first row has a minimum height of 100.dp and can expand to "
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        // the half of the remaining space."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        row(GridTrackSize.MinMax(100.dp, 1.fr))"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        // The second row takes the half of the remaining space."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        row(1.fr)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        // The third row has a fixed height of 200.dp."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        row(200.dp)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    },"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    modifier = Modifier.size(360.dp) // Total grid height is 360.dp"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: ") {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    PastelRedCard(\"MinMax(100.dp, 1.fr)\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        PastelGreenCard(\"Flex(1.fr)\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    PastelBlueCard(\"Fixed(200.dp)\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "![Row heights defined using the four primary track sizing options.](https://developer.android.com/static/develop/ui/compose/images/layouts/adaptive/grid/track-size-minmax.png) **Figure 4** . The first row has at least `100.dp` height."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Set the minimum grid track size to place lazy lists"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Standard flexible tracks automatically query the intrinsic sizes of"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "their children to establish a base size."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "However, Jetpack Compose prohibits querying the intrinsic sizes of"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "[`SubcomposeLayout`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/ui/layout/SubcomposeLayout.composable#SubcomposeLayout(androidx.compose.ui.Modifier,kotlin.Function2)), which backs components,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "such as [`LazyColumn`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/lazy/LazyColumn.composable) and [`LazyRow`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/lazy/LazyRow.composable)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Placing a lazy list inside a standard flexible track causes"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "an [`IllegalStateException`](https://developer.android.com/reference/java/lang/IllegalStateException) crash."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "To safely place lazy lists inside a flexible grid track,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "use `MinMax` with an explicit minimum size (such as `0.dp`)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "to bypass the intrinsic measurement pass."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Grid("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    config = {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        column(1f)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        // The first row\'s height is determined by the height of the Text composable."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        row(GridTrackSize.Auto)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        // The second row occupies the remaining space, allowing the LazyColumn to scroll."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        row(GridTrackSize.MinMax(0.dp, 1.fr))"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        gap(8.dp)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    },"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    modifier = Modifier.size(width = 170.dp, height = 240.dp)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: ") {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    Text(\"LazyColumn in a Grid\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    // The LazyColumn is placed in the second row, filling the remaining space."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    LazyColumn(verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(4.dp)) {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        items(100) { number ->"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            PastelGreenCard(\"Card $number\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "![Row heights defined using the four primary track sizing options.](https://developer.android.com/static/develop/ui/compose/images/layouts/adaptive/grid/lazy-column-in-grid.png) **Figure 5** . `LazyColumn` in a grid cell."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Determine grid track size intrinsically"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "You can use [intrinsic sizing](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/intrinsic-measurements) for a `Grid`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "when you want the layout to adapt to the content,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "rather than forcing it into a fixed container."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The grid track size is determined with the following values:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [`GridTrackSize.MaxContent`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/layout/GridTrackSize#MaxContent()): Use the content\'s maximum intrinsic size (e.g., the width is determined by the full length of the text in a text block with no wrapping)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [`GridTrackSize.MinContent`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/layout/GridTrackSize#MinContent()): Use the content\'s minimum intrinsic size (e.g., the width is determined by the longest single word in a text block)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [`GridTrackSize.Auto`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/layout/GridTrackSize#Auto()): Use a flexible size for a track that adapts based on available space. It behaves like `MaxContent` by default, but shrinks and wraps its content to fit within the parent container."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The following example places two texts side by side."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The column size for the first text is determined"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "by the required minimum width to display the text,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "and the second column width depends on the required maximum width of the text."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Grid("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    config = {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        column(GridTrackSize.MinContent)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        column(GridTrackSize.MaxContent)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        row(1.0f)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    },"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    modifier = Modifier.width(480.dp)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: ") {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    Text(\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Cras imperdiet.\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    Text(\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Cras imperdiet.\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "![Intrinsic sizes specified in the columns.](https://developer.android.com/static/develop/ui/compose/images/layouts/adaptive/grid/intrinsic-size.png) **Figure 5**. Intrinsic sizes specified in the columns."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Set gaps between rows and columns"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Once your grid tracks are sized,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "you can modify the [grid gap](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/grid#grid-gap) to refine the spacing between the tracks."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "You can specify the column gap with the [`columnGap`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/layout/GridConfigurationScope#columnGap(androidx.compose.ui.unit.Dp)) function,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "and the row gap with [`rowGap`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/foundation/layout/GridConfigurationScope#rowGap(androidx.compose.ui.unit.Dp)). In the following example,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "there is a `16dp` gap between each row,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "and an `8dp` gap between each column (Figure 5)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Grid("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    config = {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        repeat(2) {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            column(160.dp)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        repeat(3) {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
