        lines {
          text: "> [!NOTE]"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "> **Note:** \"media\" refers to the presentation medium that the UI is rendered on. The term \"media\" originates from [CSS media queries](https://www.w3.org/TR/mediaqueries-3/) which inspired the `mediaQuery` API."
