    diff {
      unified_diff {
        lines {
          text: "Provides commands to interact with AppFunctions on a connected device or"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "emulator using ADB for AppFunction testing and debugging."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Instructions"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Scenario 1: List app functions"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Use this scenario when you want to see which app functions are registered on"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "the device."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **List all functions** : To view all registered app functions in JSON format, run `adb shell cmd app_function list-app-functions`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Filter by package** : To view functions for a specific package, pipe the output to `grep` or a JSON tool: `adb shell cmd app_function"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   list-app-functions | grep <package_name>`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Scenario 2: Invoke app functions"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "If you want to test the execution of an app function, use this scenario."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Analyze description** : Before invoking, you must read the `description` field for the function in the `list-app-functions` output. This often contains critical usage constraints, required workflows, or disambiguation rules."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Follow constraints**: Follow all instructions in the description, such as asking the user to disambiguate or calling another tool first."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Format parameters** : Format the `--parameters` argument as a valid JSON string that represents the function\'s input arguments."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. **Execute function** : Use `adb shell cmd app_function execute-app-function"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   --package <PACKAGE_NAME> --function <SERVICE_CLASS_NAME#FUNCTION_NAME>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   --parameters \'<PARAMETERS_JSON>\'`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. **Handle response** : The command returns the result as a JSON string. To get brief YAML output, use `--brief-yaml`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Scenario 3: Manage function state"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "If you need to enable or disable an app function for testing, use this scenario."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Set enabled state** : Use `adb shell cmd app_function set-enabled"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   --package <PACKAGE_NAME>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   --function <SERVICE_CLASS_NAME#FUNCTION_NAME>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   --state <enable|disable|default>`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Critical constraints"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Follow metadata descriptions"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Mandatory** : The `description` field in the app function metadata is a set of"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "instructions for the LLM. If a description says to \"disambiguate with the user\""
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "or \"call another function first,\" you must perform those steps before execution."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### JSON escaping"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Critical** : When passing JSON using `adb shell`, always wrap the JSON string"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "in single quotes to prevent the shell from interpreting special characters or"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "spaces. Example: `--parameters \'{\"key\": \"value\"}\'`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Device availability"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The `app_function` service must be available on the device. If `cmd: Can\'t find"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "service: app_function` is returned, the device doesn\'t support this feature."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Examples"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Example 1: Verify app function service availability on connected device"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    adb shell cmd app_function help"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "If executing the preceding command returns a help page, use the commands and"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "parameters provided to guide the ADB interaction testing tool interactions."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Example 2: List all registered app functions"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     adb shell cmd app_function list-app-functions"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Example 3: Execute a \"send message\" function"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     adb shell cmd app_function execute-app-function \\"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     --package com.example.messaging \\"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     --function"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    \'com.example.messaging.appfunctions.MessagingAppFunctionService#sendMessage\' \\"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     --parameters \'{\"recipient\": \"Alice\", \"message\": \"Hello!\"}\'"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Example 4: Disable a specific function"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     adb shell cmd app_function set-enabled --package com.example.app \\"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     --function \'com.example.app.appfunctions.SomeAppFunctionService#someFunction\'"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    --state disable"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Troubleshooting"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Error: \"Unknown command\""
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Cause**: You are likely using an older version of the instructions."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Solution**: Look up supported commands using \"Example 1\"."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Error: \"Function not found\""
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Cause**: The function ID or package name is incorrect."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Solution** : Run `list-app-functions` and search for the relevant identifiers"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "in the JSON output."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
