        lines {
          text: "# Bottom Sheet Recipe"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "This recipe demonstrates how to display a destination as a modal bottom sheet."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## How it works"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "To show a destination as a bottom sheet, you need to do two things:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Use `BottomSheetSceneStrategy`** : Create an instance of `BottomSheetSceneStrategy` and pass it to the `sceneStrategy` parameter of the `NavDisplay` composable."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Add metadata to the destination** : For the destination that you want to display as a bottom sheet, add `BottomSheetSceneStrategy.bottomSheet()` to its metadata. This is done in the `entry` function."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "In this example, `RouteB` is configured to be a bottom sheet. When you navigate from `RouteA` to `RouteB`, `RouteB` will be displayed in a modal bottom sheet that slides up from the bottom of the screen."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The content of the bottom sheet can be styled as needed. In this recipe, the content is clipped to have rounded corners."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "For more information, see the official documentation on [custom layouts](https://developer.android.com/guide/navigation/navigation-3/custom-layouts)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "[![](https://developer.android.com/static/images/picto-icons/code.svg) Explore View the full recipe on GitHub.](https://github.com/android/nav3-recipes/tree/main/app/src/main/java/com/example/nav3recipes/bottomsheet)"
