          text: "# Conditional Transitions Recipe"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "This recipe demonstrates how to create route-dependent screen transitions in Navigation 3 using `transitionSpec` and `popTransitionSpec`. The slide directions (right, left, bottom, top) are conditionally selected based on pairs of `initialState` and `targetState` navigation keys."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## How it works"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Route Definitions** : Navigation destinations (`Step1`, `Step2`, `Step3`, `Step4`) are defined using a sealed class hierarchy implementing `NavKey` and marked with `@Serializable`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Conditional Forward Transitions (`transitionSpec`)** : Matches pairs of `(initialKey to targetKey)` to determine the direction of the slide animation:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - `Step1` $\\\\rightarrow$ `Step2`: Swipes to the left"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - `Step2` $\\\\rightarrow$ `Step3`: Swipes to the up"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - `Step3` $\\\\rightarrow$ `Step4`: Swipes to the right"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - `Step4` $\\\\rightarrow$ `Step1`: Slides to the bottom (restarts flow)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Conditional Pop Transitions (`popTransitionSpec`)**: Handles reverse slide directions when navigating back or when clearing the backstack."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Backstack Control** : Demonstrates clearing the navigation stack on the final step (`backStack.clear()` \\& `backStack.add(Step1)`) while executing a seamless top-slide transition."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
