          text: "2. `MainActivity` parses the intent into the target navigation key."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## How it works"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The `MainActivity` handles the request with these steps"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. Declare a `UriDeepLinkMatcher` for each url pattern that can be deep linked into. Each matcher accepts a uri pattern and the KSerializer of the NavKey that supports this deep link."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. Create a `DeepLinkRequest` with the incoming intent."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. Match all candidate `UriDeepLinkMatchers` with the request and compare the resulting `UriMatchResults` for the best match."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. Read the matching key from `UriMatchResult.key` or use default key if no match."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "This recipe focuses on handing an intent and does not include these considerations:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Create synthetic backStack"
