          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "This recipe demonstrates how to pass navigation arguments (keys) to a `ViewModel` using Hilt for dependency injection."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## How it works"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "This example uses Dagger/Hilt\'s assisted injection feature:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. The `ViewModel` is annotated with `@HiltViewModel` and its constructor uses `@AssistedInject` to receive the navigation key (which is annotated with `@Assisted`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. An `@AssistedFactory` interface is defined to create the `ViewModel`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. The `hiltViewModel` composable function is used to obtain the `ViewModel` instance. A `creationCallback` is provided to pass the navigation key to the factory, making it available to the `ViewModel`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Note** : The `rememberViewModelStoreNavEntryDecorator` is added to the `NavDisplay`\'s `entryDecorators`. This ensures that `ViewModel`s are correctly scoped to their corresponding `NavEntry`, so that a new `ViewModel` instance is created for each unique navigation key."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "[![](https://developer.android.com/static/images/picto-icons/code.svg) Explore View the full recipe on GitHub.](https://github.com/android/nav3-recipes/tree/main/app/src/main/java/com/example/nav3recipes/passingarguments/viewmodels/hilt)"
