    diff {
      unified_diff {
        lines {
          text: "To implement a robust navigation system, your app needs a centralized way to"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "handle back gestures and other navigation signals. This page describes how to"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "use [`NavigationEventDispatcher`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/navigationevent/NavigationEventDispatcher) to coordinate and distribute these"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "navigation events across your application."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Declare a `NavigationEventDispatcher`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The `NavigationEventDispatcher` is the central component of the"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "`NavigationEvent` library. It acts as an event hub that dispatches"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "navigation-related events, such as back gestures and navigation transitions, to"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "registered listeners within your app. Components can subscribe to these events"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "to react to navigation changes or other system-driven navigation actions."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "You should provide `NavigationEventDispatcher` instances through a"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "[`NavigationEventDispatcherOwner`](https://developer.android.com/reference/androidx/navigationevent/NavigationEventDispatcherOwner). This ensures that different parts of your"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "app can access the same dispatcher and observe navigation events in a consistent"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "and coordinated way."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "class MyComponent: NavigationEventDispatcherOwner {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    override val navigationEventDispatcher: NavigationEventDispatcher ="
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        NavigationEventDispatcher()"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "If you are inside of a `ComponentActivity`, instead of implementing your own"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "dispatcher, you can retrieve the one provided for you."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "class MyCustomActivity : ComponentActivity() {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    fun addMyHandler() {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        // navigationEventDispatcher provided by the ComponentActivity"
