          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  }`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 5. Accessing Private Members"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Scenario:** Using reflection to access internal fields or methods not exposed"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "with public APIs."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Look for:** `getDeclaredField(\"...\")` or `getDeclaredMethod(\"...\")` followed by `isAccessible = true`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Example Code:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  `kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  val secretField = instance::class.java.getDeclaredField(\"secretMessage\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  secretField.isAccessible = true`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Suggested Keep Rule:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  \\`\\`\\`proguard"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  # Specifically keep the private field/method by name and type"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  -keepclassmembers class com.example.LibraryClass {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  private java.lang.String secretMessage;"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  \\`\\`\\`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 6. Parcelable (Manual Implementation)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Scenario:** Implementing `Parcelable` without using the `@Parcelize`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "annotation."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Look for:** `implements Parcelable` and a static `CREATOR` field."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Example Code:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  `kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  class MyData : Parcelable {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  // Manual implementation with CREATOR field"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  }`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Suggested Keep Rule:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  *(Note: If using `import kotlinx.parcelize.Parcelize`, R8/ProGuard rules are"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  generated automatically. If manual, use the following:)*"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  `proguard"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  -keepclassmembers class * implements android.os.Parcelable {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  static android.os.Parcelable$Creator CREATOR;"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  }`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 7. Enums and Obfuscation"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Scenario:** App uses `Enum.valueOf(\"STRING_NAME\")` indirectly (e.g.,using JSON"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "deserialization) and the enum names get obfuscated."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Look for:** Unnecessary generic Enum keep rules in ProGuard files."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Example Code:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  \\`\\`\\`proguard"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  # Unnecessary rule"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  -keepclassmembers enum \\* { \\*; }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  \\`\\`\\`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Suggested Keep Rule:**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  \\*(Note: The default `proguard-android-optimize.txt` already contains the optimal"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  rules for Enums (keeping `values()` and `valueOf(String)`). Any additional"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  manual rules for Enums are redundant.) # No manual rule needed. Use default"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  proguard-android-optimize.txt."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
      }
    }
  }
