          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "> optimization](https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/app-optimization/test-and-troubleshoot-the-optimization). For more information about enabling R8 from libraries, see [Optimization for library authors](https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/app-optimization/library-optimization)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## R8 optimization overview"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "R8 uses a multi-phase process to optimize your app for size and speed. Key"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "operations include the following:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Code shrinking (also known as tree shaking)** : R8 identifies and removes"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  unreachable code from your application and its library dependencies. By"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  analyzing the entry points of your app (such as `Activities` or `Services`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  defined in the manifest), R8 builds a graph of referenced code and removes"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  anything that remains unreferenced."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Logical optimizations**: R8 rewrites your code to improve execution"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  efficiency and reduce overhead. Key techniques include:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - **Method inlining**: R8 replaces a method call site with the actual body"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    of the called method. This eliminates the overhead of a function call"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    and lets R8 conduct further optimizations."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - **Class merging**: R8 combines sets of classes and interfaces into a"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    single class. This reduces the number of classes in the app, lowering"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    memory pressure and improving startup speed."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Obfuscation (also known as minification)** : To reduce the size of the DEX"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  file, R8 shortens the names of classes, fields, and methods (for example,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  `com.example.MyActivity` could become `a.b.a`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Since 8.12.0 version of Android Gradle Plugin (AGP), R8 also optimizes resources"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "as part of its optimization phases. For more information, see [Optimized"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "resource shrinking](https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/app-optimization/enable-app-optimization#optimize-resource-shrinking)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Enable optimization"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "To enable app optimization for your app use the appropriate DSL based on your"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "project\'s AGP version. We recommend enabling app optimization only in the final"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "version of your app that you test before publishing---usually your release"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "build---because the optimizations increase the build time of your project and can"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "make debugging harder due to the way it modifies code."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### For AGP versions 9.3 and higher"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "To enable app optimization for AGP 9.3 and higher:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Set `enable = true` in the `optimization` block in your release build\'s app-level build script."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Add your [keep rules](https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/app-optimization/add-keep-rules) to a file with the suffix `.keep` in the `src/<variant>/keepRules` source set. For example, `src/main/keepRules/custom-rules.keep`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "> [!NOTE]"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "> **Note:** The updated DSL enables both code and resource optimization. It also includes a set of default keep rules for the Android platform, equivalent to \"proguard-android-optimize.txt\". To omit the default rules, see [Omit default"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "> rules](https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/app-optimization/keep-rules-overview#omit-default)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    android {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
