          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  - Modifier.styleable"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Limitations"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Warn the user that this skill is EXPERIMENTAL and requires updating to alpha version of Compose and opting in to the Experimental APIs."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- This skill only supports custom UI components and custom themes."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- This skill does not support Material Design component Styles."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Prerequisites"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 1. Upgrade dependencies"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- The project must use `compileSdk` version 37 or higher."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- The project must use `androidx.compose.foundation:foundation` version `1.12.0-alpha01` or higher."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Alternatively, the project must use Compose BOM version `2026.04.01` or higher."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- The API requires this exact package: `import"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  androidx.compose.foundation.style.Style`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 2. Configure compiler options to enable experimental API"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "You must opt-in to the experimental API at the project level. Add the following"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "block to your module\'s `build.gradle.kts`:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    kotlin {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        compilerOptions {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            jvmTarget = JvmTarget.fromTarget(\"17\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            freeCompilerArgs.add(\"-opt-in=androidx.compose.foundation.style.ExperimentalFoundationStyleApi\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Core workflows and guides"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Refer to the official documentation to complete specific development tasks:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Basic Style Usage: To set backgrounds, sizes, and alignments on a component, follow the [Compose Styles Fundamentals"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  Guide](references/android/develop/ui/compose/styles/fundamentals.md)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- State and Transitions: To configure property changes for state shifts (like pressed or hovered), follow the [Animations and State-Based Styling"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  Guide](references/android/develop/ui/compose/styles/state-animations.md)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Architecture Trade offs: To decide when to use a Style versus a standard Modifier, follow the [Styles versus Modifiers"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "  Comparison](references/android/develop/ui/compose/styles/styles-vs-modifiers.md)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Theme Level Integration: To connect style definitions with custom themes, follow [Theming with Styles](references/android/develop/ui/compose/styles/theming.md) and [Custom Themes in Compose](references/android/develop/ui/compose/designsystems/custom.md)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Step-by-Step Migration Workflow"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Step 1: Analyze theme structure"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. Locate your central theme file (such as `Theme.kt`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. Identify design tokens. Note references for colors, typography, and shapes (for example, `LocalColorScheme`, `LocalTypography`, or `LocalShapes`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. If the project lacks Jetpack Compose dependencies, stop. Instruct the user to migrate to Jetpack Compose first."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. If the project imports `androidx.compose.material.MaterialTheme`, recommend migrating to Material 3 before proceeding."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Step 2: Establish `ComponentStyles`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. Create a new file named `ComponentStyles.kt` in your theme directory."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. Define a top-level data class to hold your component styles, for example, the Jetsnack one is called `JetsnackStyles`:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   ```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   object ExampleComponentStyles {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       val customButtonStyle: Style = {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       val customTextFieldStyle: Style = {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   ```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   <br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. Expose this class through your custom theme with a static reference, don\'t"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   use `CompositionLocals` here as it\'s not required."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   ```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   @Immutable"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   class JetsnackTheme("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       // other Design system properties"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   ) {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       companion object {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "           val colors: CustomThemingWithStyles.JetsnackColors"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "               @Composable @ReadOnlyComposable"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "               get() = LocalJetsnackTheme.current.colors"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "           // ..."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "           // add helper static reference"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "           val styles: ComponentStyles = ComponentStyles"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   ```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   <br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. Provide extensions on `StyleScope` to reference theme tokens directly if"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   they are exposed using `CompositionLocals`. For example:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   ```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   val StyleScope.colors: JetsnackColors"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       get() = LocalJetsnackTheme.currentValue.colors"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   val StyleScope.typography: androidx.compose.material3.Typography"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       get() = LocalJetsnackTheme.currentValue.typography"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   val StyleScope.shapes: Shapes"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "       get() = LocalJetsnackTheme.currentValue.shapes"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   ```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   <br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Step 3: Migrate a component to Styles API"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "For each custom component (for example, `CustomButton`), complete the following"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "sequence:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Establish a visual baseline (If an emulator is available):**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **If you CANNOT run an Android emulator:** Skip this step entirely and proceed to Step 2."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **If you CAN run an Android emulator:** Perform the following to capture a baseline screenshot:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     - **Option A:** Locate and run an existing screenshot test for the component."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     - **Option B (If no test exists):** Create a test using the project\'s existing testing framework, then run it."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "     - **Option C (If no framework exists):** Create a minimal screenshot test using UI Automator or Espresso, then run it."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Remove individual styling parameters** : Remove styling parameters such as `backgroundColor`, `shape`, `textStyle`, and `contentPadding` from the signature - anything that `StyleScope` supports."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Add the style parameter** : Add `style: Style = Style` to the function signature. Always ensure the default value is exactly `Style` (e.g., `style:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   Style = Style`) and not a specific style default like `ChipStyleDefault` or any other value."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. **Declare state tracking** : If the component is interactable, create a `MutableStyleState` using the interaction source. Update state fields (such as `isEnabled`) inside the Composable to track the state correctly."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. **Apply styleable modifier** : Replace specific layout modifiers on the root element with `Modifier.styleable()`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "6. **Move defaults to ComponentStyles** : Move hardcoded values from the component definition to a dedicated `Style` instance in `ComponentStyles.kt`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "7. **Validate component:** Compare the baseline screenshot image taken at the start with the rendered Compose Preview of the new composable. Ignore string content; focus on layout and styling. Iterate on the Compose code until visual parity is achieved. Once verified, write a Compose UI test for the new composable."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "#### Migration example"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
