  file_change {
    absolute_path_uri: "file:///.agents/skills/styles/references/android/develop/ui/compose/designsystems/custom.md"
    file_change_type: FILE_CHANGE_TYPE_CREATE
    diff {
      unified_diff {
        lines {
          text: "While Material is our recommended design system and Jetpack Compose ships an"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "implementation of Material, you are not forced to use it. Material is built"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "entirely on public APIs, so it\'s possible to create your own design system in"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "the same manner."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "There are several approaches you might take:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [Extend `MaterialTheme`](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/designsystems/custom#extending-material) with additional theming values."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [Replace one or more Material systems](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/designsystems/custom#replacing-systems) --- `Colors`, `Typography`, or `Shapes` --- with custom implementations while keeping the others."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- [Implement a fully custom design system](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/designsystems/custom#implementing-fully-custom) to replace `MaterialTheme`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "You may also want to continue using Material components with a custom design"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "system. It\'s possible to do this but there are things to keep in mind to suit"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "the approach you\'ve taken."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "To learn more about the lower-level constructs and APIs used by `MaterialTheme`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "and custom design systems, check out the [Anatomy of a theme in Compose](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/designsystems/anatomy) guide."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## Extend Material Theming"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Compose Material closely models"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "[Material Theming](https://m3.material.io/)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "to make it straightforward and type-safe to follow the Material guidelines."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "However, it\'s possible to extend the color, typography, and shape sets with"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "additional values. The simplest approach is to add extension properties:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "// Use with MaterialTheme.colorScheme.snackbarAction"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "val ColorScheme.snackbarAction: Color"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    @Composable"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    get() = if (isSystemInDarkTheme()) Red300 else Red700"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "// Use with MaterialTheme.typography.textFieldInput"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "val Typography.textFieldInput: TextStyle"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    get() = TextStyle(/* ... */)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "// Use with MaterialTheme.shapes.card"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "val Shapes.card: Shape"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    get() = RoundedCornerShape(size = 20.dp)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "<br />"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "This provides consistency with `MaterialTheme` usage APIs. An example of this"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "defined by Compose itself is"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "[`surfaceColorAtElevation`](https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/material3/package-summary#(androidx.compose.material3.ColorScheme).surfaceColorAtElevation(androidx.compose.ui.unit.Dp)),"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "which determines the surface color that should be used depending on the"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "elevation."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "> [!NOTE]"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "> **Note:** This approach is only recommended for straightforward theming value additions, or for values that are the same in different themes. If you have multiple themes, it\'s better to define a class with new properties instead."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Another approach is to define an extended theme that \"wraps\" `MaterialTheme` and"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "its values."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Suppose you want to add two additional colors --- `caution` and `onCaution`, a"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "yellow color used for actions that are semi-dangerous --- whilst keeping the"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "existing Material colors:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```kotlin"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "@Immutable"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "data class ExtendedColors("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    val caution: Color,"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
