        }
        lines {
          text: "Integrating private-agent\'s screen parsing logic will **dramatically improve Easy Launcher\'s reliability** across diverse apps without breaking Easy Launcher\'s core strength: **Gemini Nano offline inference**. The migration is **low-risk** (backward compatible), **phased** (deliverables every 1-2 weeks), and **testable** (comprehensive test coverage at each phase)."
